n8n → Render.com Migration
Complete Agent Briefing & Implementation Guide
Project: DemGrow Smart Campaign Platform
Date: March 2026  |  Version: 1.0

1. Why We Are Migrating
The current email automation backend runs on n8n. We are switching to a custom Node.js server on Render.com for the following reasons:

Current Problem
n8n has limited free tier and is not ideal for always-on automation
New Solution
Custom Node.js server on Render.com — fully controlled and free
Keep Alive
cron-job.org pings the server every 10 minutes to prevent sleep
Database
Switching from Supabase to InsForge (AI-native Postgres alternative)
Email Provider
Gmail SMTP via Nodemailer (configured inside Node.js server)
Daily Runtime
6–7 hours continuously per day
Total Cost
$0/month — fully free stack


